{"version":1,"content":"<p>積架路虎與比亞迪Ti7的知識產權糾紛迎來關鍵程序性裁定。荷蘭海牙法院正式駁回積架路虎提出的證據保全申請，不同意其對比亞迪相關辦公資料開展突擊搜查、調取內部研發文件的訴求。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586036.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:23:50.596493+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:07:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:14.147077+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:14.147077+00:00","content_hash":"b9ecd36e99e8cf9a49a9cfd9a73c9496bcfed9c99bcee2bc992f0f390d8852e3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}